      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your policy memo.\n\nThis policy should affirm your commitment to an inclusive and respectful workplace for all team members, regardless of political views. It should clearly state that while individual political opinion is respected, all discourse in company channels must adhere to professional, respectful, and non-hostile standards. The policy should define clear boundaries around partisan advocacy and political debate in the professional and internal context to maintain focus and unity in the organization.",
